Z||000000||TN Fieros||06-20-2001||10:25 PM||||All members of Tennessee Fiero Owners (or Fiero owners in TN or surrounding area)..<P>We are on a drive to get everyone involved on the PFF. Please post a message here so we can see how many are here and how many we still need to get signed up. Car pics would be nice if you have them...<P>Also, we are trying to get something going for Saturday, June 30th. It can be a cruise of some kind or Allan has offered his big yard at his house for a kind of club swap/fixit party. Maybe we can talk him into a cookout too!<P>Lastly, I am redoing the website and need as many member car pics as possible. Send pics and info to tnfieros@home.com to be included when the new site goes up in the next few days.<P>Thanks.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
