Z||000007||Butter||06-22-2001||12:46 PM||||tryin' again<P>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1624130&a=12407698&p=45522217&Sequence=2">    <BR>css syndrome<P>Thanks Songman,<BR>Got to get with yall sometime.  I think you know my home situation as I had stated in an earlier tnfiero post.  She has fell 3 more times since her recovery and substained fear as the only problem.  Lucky huh.  Better not say much more about it somebody might want to put a seatbelt on her. haha  I do however try to keep up on yall's post and if I get a chance, I WILL get to meet yall.  You play music somewhere?  Could be another good reason to convince my girlfriend to get out of the house.  Merle's COOL!<p>[This message has been edited by Butter (edited 06-22-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000008||Songman||06-22-2001||10:15 PM||||Just let me know anytime you can get away for a little while. I bet at least me, Keith, and Allan would caravan out close to you some Saturday. We like driving and meeting other Fiero people...<P>Hope things improve on the homefront. I still commend you for what you are doing..<P>Yeah, I travel around and play. Never really around Nashville all that much though. People want you to play for free in Nashville! heheh There was a day when that was cool, and still is sometimes but since it is my career now it don't pay the bills.. Mostly in the studio right now till the CD is done anyway.<P>Send an e-mail, either to me or the list, with some info on you and your car for the site whenever you get time... Thanks.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
