Z||000011||TN Fieros||06-25-2001||12:30 AM||||It's really pretty easy. There are no dues or anything at this time. Just click the link below and join the mailing list. That is the member roster for the time being. That way we are all in touch and can hopefully find ways to get together.<P>This Saturday we are meeting at Allan's house which is just about 30 miles South of Nashville if anyone can make it.. Sure would like to meet some more of you...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
