Z||000015||spideyfoot||06-27-2001||09:41 AM||||That's it I'm pretty dang excited now. Will your guitar fit in your trunk Dale we can jam too. I've got an extra 12 string and a classical here. Oh yea directions uh. I live on highway 96 right  outside of Murfreesboro TN. You can take 24 to get there or 65 my road runs between them . From 24 go to exit 78a its runs you my way (towards Franklin) you'll go by a Hardees, Golden Gallon, Franklin Rd Babtist Church on your right and Ill be 1/2 block away on your left ( I can see the church from my front window) Its 3261 Franklin Rd Ill Put a balloon on my mailbox or a Fiero out front or something to get your attention. From 65 take highway 96 it may be called Murfreesboro rd at that exit towards Murfreesboro. Drive about 20-25minutes Ill be on the right past the Volunteer fire station. If you hit highway 24 you have gone to far follow above directions. ||||reg||1
Z||000016||Songman||06-28-2001||09:48 PM||||Looks like the time to meet at the above spot is 1:00 in the afternoon on Saturday.<P>Everyone is invited! You don't have to be from Tennessee if you just want to come hang out for the day! We'll be glad to see you!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
